114
00:09:04,140 --> 00:09:08,140
Ah, where did I put it?

115
00:09:08,140 --> 00:09:10,140
Aha, here it is.

116
00:09:10,140 --> 00:09:11,140
Huh?

117
00:09:11,140 --> 00:09:12,140
