133
00:09:44,140 --> 00:09:45,140
Mr. Doom.

134
00:09:45,140 --> 00:09:46,140
Hmm?

135
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:47,140
Can we please move on now?

136
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:48,140
Yeah, sure.

137
00:09:48,140 --> 00:09:49,140
That's my bad.

138
00:09:52,140 --> 00:09:53,140
Listen up.

139
00:09:53,140 --> 00:09:57,140
So you've actually collected all 100 cards that Greed Island has to offer.

140
00:09:57,140 --> 00:09:58,140
Well done.

141
00:09:58,140 --> 00:10:00,140
That milestone triggers a new event.

142
00:10:00,140 --> 00:10:02,140
